<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Agile Kubernetes Portal</title>
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@300;400;500;600;700;800&family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@400;500;600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  <style>
    :root {
      --bg-dark: #0a0d14;
      --bg-card: rgba(17, 24, 39, 0.75);
      --bg-card-hover: rgba(31, 41, 55, 0.85);
      --border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
      --border-accent: rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.5);
      --primary: #3b82f6;
      --primary-glow: rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.35);
      --cyan: #06b6d4;
      --cyan-glow: rgba(6, 182, 212, 0.35);
      --emerald: #10b981;
      --emerald-glow: rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.25);
      --violet: #8b5cf6;
      --text-main: #f9fafb;
      --text-muted: #9ca3af;
      --mono: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
      --sans: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif;
    }

    * {
      box-sizing: border-box;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
    }

    body {
      background-color: var(--bg-dark);
      background-image: 
        radial-gradient(at 0% 0%, rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.15) 0px, transparent 50%),
        radial-gradient(at 100% 0%, rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.15) 0px, transparent 50%),
        radial-gradient(at 50% 100%, rgba(6, 182, 212, 0.1) 0px, transparent 50%);
      background-attachment: fixed;
      color: var(--text-main);
      font-family: var(--sans);
      min-height: 100vh;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: center;
      padding: 2.5rem 1.5rem;
    }

    .container {
      width: 100%;
      max-width: 1100px;
    }

    /* Top Navigation / Brand bar */
    .nav-bar {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
      padding: 1rem 1.5rem;
      background: var(--bg-card);
      backdrop-filter: blur(16px);
      border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
      border-radius: 16px;
      margin-bottom: 2rem;
      box-shadow: 0 8px 32px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);
    }

    .brand-group {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 0.85rem;
    }

    .brand-icon {
      width: 42px;
      height: 42px;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--cyan), var(--primary));
      border-radius: 12px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      font-size: 1.5rem;
      box-shadow: 0 0 15px var(--cyan-glow);
    }

    .brand-title {
      font-size: 1.25rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: -0.02em;
      background: linear-gradient(to right, #fff, #93c5fd);
      -webkit-background-clip: text;
      -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
    }

    .status-badge {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 0.5rem;
      padding: 0.4rem 0.9rem;
      background: rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.1);
      border: 1px solid rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.3);
      border-radius: 9999px;
      color: #34d399;
      font-size: 0.825rem;
      font-weight: 600;
    }

    .status-dot {
      width: 8px;
      height: 8px;
      background-color: #10b981;
      border-radius: 50%;
      box-shadow: 0 0 10px #10b981;
      animation: pulse 2s infinite;
    }

    @keyframes pulse {
      0%, 100% { opacity: 1; transform: scale(1); }
      50% { opacity: 0.5; transform: scale(0.85); }
    }

    /* Hero Section */
    .hero {
      text-align: center;
      padding: 3rem 1rem 2.5rem;
      position: relative;
    }

    .hero-tag {
      display: inline-block;
      font-family: var(--mono);
      font-size: 0.8rem;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.15em;
      color: var(--cyan);
      background: rgba(6, 182, 212, 0.1);
      border: 1px solid rgba(6, 182, 212, 0.3);
      padding: 0.35rem 1rem;
      border-radius: 9999px;
      margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
    }

    h1 {
      font-size: 3rem;
      font-weight: 800;
      line-height: 1.15;
      margin-bottom: 1rem;
      letter-spacing: -0.03em;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #ffffff 30%, #60a5fa 70%, #a78bfa 100%);
      -webkit-background-clip: text;
      -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
    }

    .hero-sub {
      font-size: 1.15rem;
      color: var(--text-muted);
      max-width: 650px;
      margin: 0 auto 2rem;
      line-height: 1.6;
    }

    /* Stats Grid */
    .stats-bar {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(200px, 1fr));
      gap: 1rem;
      margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
    }

    .stat-card {
      background: var(--bg-card);
      backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
      border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
      border-radius: 14px;
      padding: 1.25rem;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 0.35rem;
      transition: all 0.3s ease;
    }

    .stat-card:hover {
      border-color: var(--border-accent);
      transform: translateY(-2px);
      box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4);
    }

    .stat-label {
      font-size: 0.775rem;
      color: var(--text-muted);
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.05em;
      font-weight: 600;
    }

    .stat-value {
      font-size: 1.2rem;
      font-family: var(--mono);
      font-weight: 700;
      color: #fff;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 0.5rem;
    }

    /* DevOps Feature Cards */
    .features-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(300px, 1fr));
      gap: 1.5rem;
      margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
    }

    .feature-card {
      background: var(--bg-card);
      backdrop-filter: blur(14px);
      border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
      border-radius: 16px;
      padding: 1.75rem;
      transition: all 0.3s ease;
      position: relative;
      overflow: hidden;
    }

    .feature-card::before {
      content: '';
      position: absolute;
      top: 0;
      left: 0;
      right: 0;
      height: 3px;
      background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--cyan), var(--primary), var(--violet));
      opacity: 0;
      transition: opacity 0.3s ease;
    }

    .feature-card:hover {
      background: var(--bg-card-hover);
      border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2);
      transform: translateY(-4px);
      box-shadow: 0 15px 35px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4);
    }

    .feature-card:hover::before {
      opacity: 1;
    }

    .feature-icon {
      font-size: 1.75rem;
      margin-bottom: 1rem;
      display: inline-block;
    }

    .feature-title {
      font-size: 1.2rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
      color: #fff;
    }

    .feature-desc {
      font-size: 0.925rem;
      color: var(--text-muted);
      line-height: 1.55;
      margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
    }

    .feature-badge {
      display: inline-block;
      font-family: var(--mono);
      font-size: 0.75rem;
      padding: 0.25rem 0.65rem;
      border-radius: 6px;
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
      border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
      color: #93c5fd;
    }

    /* Actions and Interactive Panel */
    .action-panel {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(17, 24, 39, 0.9), rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.8));
      border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
      border-radius: 16px;
      padding: 2rem;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: center;
      text-align: center;
      gap: 1.5rem;
      box-shadow: 0 12px 30px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4);
    }

    .action-title {
      font-size: 1.35rem;
      font-weight: 700;
    }

    .action-sub {
      color: var(--text-muted);
      max-width: 520px;
      font-size: 0.95rem;
    }

    .buttons-group {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      justify-content: center;
      gap: 1rem;
    }

    .btn {
      padding: 0.75rem 1.6rem;
      border-radius: 10px;
      font-size: 0.925rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      cursor: pointer;
      transition: all 0.25s ease;
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 0.5rem;
      text-decoration: none;
    }

    .btn-primary {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #2563eb, #1d4ed8);
      color: #fff;
      border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2);
      box-shadow: 0 4px 15px var(--primary-glow);
    }

    .btn-primary:hover {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #3b82f6, #2563eb);
      box-shadow: 0 6px 20px var(--primary-glow);
      transform: translateY(-2px);
    }

    .btn-secondary {
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
      color: #e5e7eb;
      border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
    }

    .btn-secondary:hover {
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
      border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.3);
      transform: translateY(-2px);
    }

    /* Footer */
    footer {
      margin-top: 3.5rem;
      text-align: center;
      font-size: 0.85rem;
      color: var(--text-muted);
    }

    footer code {
      font-family: var(--mono);
      color: var(--cyan);
    }

    /* Responsive */
    @media (max-width: 768px) {
      h1 { font-size: 2.2rem; }
      .nav-bar { flex-direction: column; gap: 1rem; text-align: center; }
      .brand-group { flex-direction: column; }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="container">
    <!-- Top Nav -->
    <header class="nav-bar">
      <div class="brand-group">
        <div class="brand-icon">☸️</div>
        <div>
          <div class="brand-title">Agile Kubernetes Portal</div>
          <div style="font-size: 0.75rem; color: var(--text-muted);">DevOps & Container Orchestration Lab</div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="status-badge">
        <span class="status-dot"></span>
        <span>Cluster: Online & Ready</span>
      </div>
    </header>

    <!-- Hero -->
    <section class="hero">
      <div class="hero-tag">🚀 Agile Sprint & Continuous Delivery</div>
      <h1>Agile Kubernetes Portal</h1>
      <p class="hero-sub">
        Production-grade containerized microservice deployed via Kubernetes, featuring automated rollouts, readiness probes, configuration maps, and resilient storage.
      </p>
    </section>

    <!-- Cluster Metrics & Deployment Info -->
    <section class="stats-bar">
      <div class="stat-card">
        <span class="stat-label">Image Target</span>
        <span class="stat-value" style="font-size: 0.95rem; color: #38bdf8;">harikrishna7416/agile-kubernetes:latest</span>
      </div>
      <div class="stat-card">
        <span class="stat-label">Target Service</span>
        <span class="stat-value">NodePort :30007</span>
      </div>
      <div class="stat-card">
        <span class="stat-label">App Port</span>
        <span class="stat-value">Port 3000</span>
      </div>
      <div class="stat-card">
        <span class="stat-label">Replicas</span>
        <span class="stat-value">2 Active Pods</span>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- DevOps Features -->
    <section class="features-grid">
      <div class="feature-card">
        <div class="feature-icon">⚡</div>
        <h3 class="feature-title">Agile CI/CD Pipelines</h3>
        <p class="feature-desc">Continuous integration via Jenkins and Docker build runners, pushing automated updates directly to production.</p>
        <span class="feature-badge">Jenkinsfile + Docker</span>
      </div>

      <div class="feature-card">
        <div class="feature-icon">☸️</div>
        <h3 class="feature-title">Kubernetes Orchestration</h3>
        <p class="feature-desc">Multi-replica Deployments and NodePort Services delivering high availability and zero-downtime rolling updates.</p>
        <span class="feature-badge">deployment.yaml</span>
      </div>

      <div class="feature-card">
        <div class="feature-icon">🔍</div>
        <h3 class="feature-title">Health & Readiness Probes</h3>
        <p class="feature-desc">Active HTTP liveness and readiness monitoring guaranteeing traffic only reaches healthy, ready-to-serve pods.</p>
        <span class="feature-badge">readiness.yaml</span>
      </div>

      <div class="feature-card">
        <div class="feature-icon">💾</div>
        <h3 class="feature-title">Persistent Volumes</h3>
        <p class="feature-desc">Resilient stateful storage mounted at <code>/app/data</code> with dynamic PersistentVolumeClaim bindings.</p>
        <span class="feature-badge">pvc.yaml</span>
      </div>

      <div class="feature-card">
        <div class="feature-icon">⚙️</div>
        <h3 class="feature-title">Config & Environment</h3>
        <p class="feature-desc">Decoupled configuration management via Kubernetes ConfigMaps injecting environment settings at runtime.</p>
        <span class="feature-badge">configmap.yaml</span>
      </div>

      <div class="feature-card">
        <div class="feature-icon">🛡️</div>
        <h3 class="feature-title">Resilience & Failure Testing</h3>
        <p class="feature-desc">Automated self-healing validation testing ImagePullBackOff scenarios and troubleshooting diagnostics.</p>
        <span class="feature-badge">failure-test.yaml</span>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Interactive Actions -->
    <section class="action-panel">
      <h2 class="action-title">Agile DevOps Control Deck</h2>
      <p class="action-sub">Manage your deployment lifecycles, monitor cluster health, and verify container rollouts directly from this portal.</p>
      <div class="buttons-group">
        <button class="btn btn-primary" onclick="alert('Cluster Status: Normal\nReplicas: 2/2 running\nImage: harikrishna7416/agile-kubernetes:latest')">
          ☸️ Check Cluster Status
        </button>
        <button class="btn btn-secondary" onclick="alert('Readiness Probe: HTTP GET / [200 OK]\nPeriod: 5s, Initial Delay: 5s')">
          🩺 Run Health Check
        </button>
        <button class="btn btn-secondary" onclick="alert('ConfigMap loaded:\nAPP_ENV=production\nPORT=3000')">
          📋 Inspect Config
        </button>
      </div>
    </section>

    <footer>
      <p>Agile Kubernetes Portal &bull; Containerized with <code>Docker</code> &amp; Orchestrated on <code>Kubernetes</code></p>
    </footer>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
